{W Pinning motif} 1. axb8=Q+ {W must contend with all the Bk Ps, and the
simplest way is to pile up on the pinned B} Kxb8 2. Rh1 {threatens mate} Rb7 3.
Rxb7+ Kxb7 4. Kf3 {getting the K into the action} c4 5. g4 {W advances a o^ of
his own, which the BK must watch} Kc7 6. Ke2 {preparing to block and capture}
d3+ 7. Kd1 Kc6 8. g5 {W distracts the BK} c2+ 9. Kd2 Kd5 (9... c1=Q+ 10. Rxc1
Kd5 11. g6 {wins}) 10. g6 Ke6 11. Rg1 c3+ 12. Kc1 d2+ 13. Kxc2 d1=Q+ 14. Kxd1 {
wins} *

