{W Stop promotion W needs to get his R to the e<-> with tempo to stop the Bk
Ps; while at the same time guarding against stalemate} 1. Bf5+ $1 (1. Bc6+ {
gaining a tempo} Kd6 2. Rd4+ Ke7 3. Re4+ Kd6 4. Rxe3 e1=Q 5. Rxe1 {is stalemate
}) 1... Kd8 2. Rd4+ Ke7 3. Re4+ Kd8 4. Bd7 $3 {releases the stalemate} Kxd7 (
4... e1=Q 5. Bb5 {and mate at e8}) 5. Rxe3 {wins} *

